{"publicId":"e205bdce-2d56-487f-b4a9-7fa3f093043b","title":"dYdX启动v9.9升级投票，计划迁移USDC至Injective应对Circle停用Noble服务","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-14T06:52:06.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-14T06:52:06.000Z","digest":"dYdX于2026-11-13启动v9.9协议升级链上投票，计划将USDC存款和提款通道从Noble迁移至Injective（若通过投票）。Circle于11月13日宣布停用Noble上USDC服务是直接诱因，投票截止时间为11月16日19:32（北京时间），升级预计在区块高度114220000执行（约11月17日17:00 UTC）。目前投票结果未公布，但Noble与Injective流动性池规模差异达1.2亿美元，可能影响dYdX衍生品市场稳定性。\n\n主报道（PANews）称将迁移USDC储备，而新报道（The Defiant）补充说明迁移范围仅限存款和提款通道，并强调现有USDC余额、抵押品及开放头寸不受影响。两者均指向Circle停用Noble服务的技术调整需求，但新旧报道对迁移对象的具体描述存在差异。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-14T07:41:34.605Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"dYdX宣布v9.9计划将USDC存款和提款通道从Noble迁移至Injective","latestReport":{"id":"ck6zgvrkh5dzexu1xjjpu3alw"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":2,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f2UkvR4Dy8m4","title":"dYdX 提出 USDC 背书从 Noble 转移到 Injective","firstReportAt":"2026-11-14T06:52:06.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"ck6zgvrkh5dzexu1xjjpu3alw","title":"dYdX宣布v9.9计划将USDC存款和提款通道从Noble迁移至Injective","summary":"dYdX宣布v9.9计划将USDC存款和提款通道从Noble迁移至Injective，该调整不影响现有USDC余额、抵押品及开放头寸。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T06:52:06.000Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"ck6zgvrkh5dzexu1xjjpu3alw","title":"dYdX宣布v9.9计划将USDC存款和提款通道从Noble迁移至Injective","summary":"dYdX宣布v9.9计划将USDC存款和提款通道从Noble迁移至Injective，该调整不影响现有USDC余额、抵押品及开放头寸。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T06:52:06.000Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T21:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T22:00:00.000Z","heat":8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T00:00:00.000Z","heat":7.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z","heat":7.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026